  "sourceTitle": "Bringing Robotics AI to Embedded Platforms: Dataset Recording, VLA Fine‑Tuning, and On‑Device Optimizations",
  "sourceBodyHash": "dd4c977124356e2becbaa71ed11d06627d3b64d846381cc1bc858ad414ead1ad",
