  "totalBlocks": 140,
  "translatedBlocks": 131,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f04316a7960aa17",
      "translationZh": "作者：Enzo Ruedas、Tess Boivin",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7b5255df036e476",
      "translationZh": "大语言模型的最新进展推动了从纯文本推理向多模态系统的转变。首先，视觉–语言模型（VLMs）集成了视觉感知能力；而最近，视觉–语言–动作（VLA）模型进一步实现了机器人动作的生成。由于计算、内存和功耗方面的严格限制，以及实时控制要求，将这些模型部署到嵌入式机器人平台上仍然是一项挑战。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "94828dedcd575d68",
      "translationZh": "在同步控制流水线中，当 VLA 运行推理时，机械臂处于空闲状态，等待指令，从而导致振荡行为和纠正延迟。为解决这一问题，异步推理可以将生成与执行解耦，实现平滑、连续的运动。然而，要使其有效，端到端推理延迟必须始终短于动作执行时长。因此，这一时间约束为模型的吞吐量设定了上限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "60341fb073767117",
      "translationZh": "将 VLA 模型引入嵌入式平台并非模型压缩问题，而是一个复杂的系统工程问题，需要架构分解、延迟感知调度以及与硬件相适配的执行方式。解决这些挑战，对于将多模态基础模型的最新进展转化为实用且可部署的嵌入式机器人系统至关重要。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c3eb8b775b9597f",
      "translationZh": "本指南介绍了 NXP 在录制可靠的机器人数据集、微调 VLA 策略（ACT 和 SmolVLA）方面的实践最佳做法，并重点展示 NXP i.MX 95 SoC 在优化后达到的实时性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "264a604934de3f6b",
      "translationZh": "🎥 数据集录制：真正重要的是什么",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "933f0620d0874b92",
      "translationZh": "高质量、一致的数据胜过“更多但杂乱”的数据。本节将来之不易的经验转化为具体的检查清单和数据模式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "06e8e4ab2a70bb60",
      "translationZh": "在我们的案例中，我们为“把茶包放进马克杯里”这一任务录制了一个数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c9a2c217ebd46c3c",
      "translationZh": "1) 一致性优先",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e97650fc9cb32f4e",
      "translationZh": "固定相机：使用刚性支架，避免位姿漂移。如果在录制或评估过程中，一个或多个相机因机器人的振动或操作员重置环境而发生位置变化，你会观察到准确率严重下降。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cead1e96f9ff816a",
      "translationZh": "可控照明：布置环境时，应尽可能确保照明可控（使用固定光源，并远离一天中会不断变化的日光）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3404c4290520b5b6",
      "translationZh": "强对比度：除非你的部署场景就是如此，否则应避免在“白底白物”的条件下训练。尽可能增大机械臂、物体与环境之间的对比度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "82f25d2fce24be81",
      "translationZh": "固定标定：确保备份机器人和遥操作设备的标定数据，这样即使代码崩溃，也不必重新录制之前的回合。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "403e25493353af1e",
      "translationZh": "不要作弊：不要使用模型在推理时无法获取的信息。在数据录制过程中，操作员很容易依赖对场景的直接目视观察。然而，这会引入数据集中不存在的信息。数据采集必须仅使用策略在运行时能够获得的相同相机输入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a7f0747b9c32ba19",
      "translationZh": "2) 使用夹爪相机（强烈推荐）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55acd5066e4dacf3",
      "translationZh": "从仅有场景视角转向混合视角可以提高整体准确率，但相机越多，对延迟的影响就越大。因此，你必须选择合适的折中方案。在我们的案例中，使用3个相机达到了这一平衡：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5cdfcf7ff75338f",
      "translationZh": "顶部",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0633e54683e7bca0",
      "translationZh": "夹爪",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58eb9032e3bb83f0",
      "translationZh": "左侧",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ff2b4737d39e0f8",
      "translationZh": "提供整个场景的全局视图。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b78a9bac7521f52c",
      "translationZh": "提供最近距离的视图，以实现精确抓取和对齐。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7db66af403309196",
      "translationZh": "补充俯视图，提供高度和深度信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6bbc85055c95a3a",
      "translationZh": "我们强烈建议使用安装在夹爪上的摄像头。它能提供近距离且与任务相关的视角，从而持续提高精细操作任务的成功率。重要的是，它也是最能有效促使操作员遵循正确数据采集规范的摄像头，让操作员能够完全依靠机器人的感知，而非直接观察场景。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0f16feadda6edf7",
      "translationZh": "安装夹爪摄像头时，我们建议使用 Velcro 或应力消除导向件固定线缆，防止其遮挡视野或在运动过程中断开连接。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "928d2fdd33464b40",
      "translationZh": "3) 改善抓握",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "759863da46c4eff1",
      "translationZh": "简单的硬件调整，例如在夹爪上套上热缩管，可以增加摩擦力、降低粗糙度、减少回合中的滑脱，并提高任务成功率（减少“差一点成功”的回合），从而提高策略学习的稳定性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6d6bdd3e3cdb1700",
      "translationZh": "4) 多样性与数据集划分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "306a3430ef3f08cd",
      "translationZh": "采集数据集时，你应该：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e8e02e576318610",
      "translationZh": "改变回合的分布：将工作空间划分为若干起始位置簇，每个簇至少采集 10 个回合。通过改变物体的位置和旋转角度来增加多样性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9525724ed7c9c941",
      "translationZh": "例如，我们将机械臂可触及的工作空间划分为 11 个簇，每个簇的尺寸为 10 × 10 cm。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69541e2a11681447",
      "translationZh": "区分训练集与验证集：策略很容易在训练集上过拟合，因此要确保验证集对模型而言是未见过的数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9cff4c6c895a8f4c",
      "translationZh": "例如，我们从训练集中移除了第 6 个簇。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf69675f0bcece42",
      "translationZh": "尽可能记录更多动作：小型 VLA 模型对未见过的动作泛化能力有限。因此，录制的片段应覆盖各个自由度上更广的运动范围。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "148df60f49808523",
      "translationZh": "例如，我们既抓取水平放置的茶包，也抓取竖直放置的茶包。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e87c8a7071a7cab",
      "translationZh": "预先考虑失败情况：有时策略第一次无法够到物体，需要“回头再试”。我们注意到，让全部片段中的 20% 对应回头再次尝试接近物体的情况，有助于模型提高整体成功率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c56d32e4dfda4676",
      "translationZh": "例如，我们训练集中约 20% 的片段是失败恢复片段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df21d4cca06e9b48",
      "translationZh": "这与 VLA 论文和社区指南中的最佳实践一致。以下是同一簇内数据多样性的 3 个示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd7c705580e046f7",
      "translationZh": "起始位置 1",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4dde1309d1747541",
      "translationZh": "起始位置 2",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "301a38edf306b9f2",
      "translationZh": "失败恢复片段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cacae7c8e0ebbafe",
      "translationZh": "起始位置 1 和 2 对应于同一簇内的不同位置。相比之下，在恢复回合中，机器人并不是从“起始模式”开始，而是已经位于马克杯附近，应直接从该位置去取茶包。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "297dc03112d70cd4",
      "translationZh": "🎛️ 微调 VLA",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "110b3b0b3bf8b289",
      "translationZh": "我们在实践中的做法：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d51fb1efe9162384",
      "translationZh": "任务：“抓取茶包并将其放入马克杯中。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "98718eaa256529c8",
      "translationZh": "数据集：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8354a2eaafe534ea",
      "translationZh": "120 个回合：10 个簇 x（10 个不同的茶包起始位置 + 2 个恢复回合）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "42af46a1e2a7eb4e",
      "translationZh": "3 个摄像头（640x480px，30fps）：顶部、夹爪、左侧",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "90b690dc962904e8",
      "translationZh": "第 6 簇被单独划出，用于验证",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d9839b68e22760a8",
      "translationZh": "批大小：8",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b5843970e4e0c4ca",
      "translationZh": "训练：在训练 200k 步后，选择验证损失最低的模型检查点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eaa6e047592923b1",
      "translationZh": "对于 ACT（每个动作块包含 100 个动作），我们发现，在 100k-160k 个训练步的范围内，模型在训练集和验证集上的准确性、泛化能力和动作平滑性之间达到了最佳平衡。对于 SMolVLA 的训练（每个动作块包含 50 个动作），这种平衡似乎要在更多训练步之后才会出现。我们发现，在模型开始过拟合后再稍微继续训练一段时间，往往能提高整体准确性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a72e69799c936a8",
      "translationZh": "经验法则：通过评估模型在训练集和验证集上的成功率来选择最终检查点，而不是依据训练损失。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cf16db8ae4284ad4",
      "translationZh": "⚡ 针对 NXP i.MX 95 应用处理器进行优化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16947d1f491d0720",
      "translationZh": "i.MX 95 SoC 集成了 6× Arm Cortex‑A55、一个 Cortex‑M7 和一个 Cortex M33 MCU、一个 Mali GPU、一个新的 NXP ISP，以及 eIQ® Neutron NPU，旨在实现高效、安全的边缘推理，并提供多摄像头支持和强大的 I/O 能力。[nxp.com]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1f6495c0851440ea",
      "translationZh": "1) 分而治之",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1dfeadbbb3c7a169",
      "translationZh": "我们没有将模型作为一个单体计算图来运行，而是将 VLA 计算图拆分为多个逻辑阶段：编码器、解码器和动作专家。这样，每个组件都可以独立进行优化、调度和部署。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20bfdba6842ae367",
      "translationZh": "在实际应用中，SmolVLA 被划分为以下子模块：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ffc1a3b579912e99",
      "translationZh": "视觉模块：处理 RGB 摄像头画面并生成视觉嵌入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "45606639ef220cbe",
      "translationZh": "LLM 主干网络：根据视觉和文本嵌入生成动作词元。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4a22c22c55244f1f",
      "translationZh": "动作专家：应用流匹配对动作样本进行迭代去噪，并输出最终控制指令。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c36e31d81add86a",
      "translationZh": "这种划分使我们能够逐模块进行优化。通过测量各模块量化带来的影响，可以在延迟和准确性之间选择最佳折中方案。此外，将动作专家与 VLM 分离，也非常适合让动作专家以较低频率运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c2df34e8e58b4891",
      "translationZh": "2) 量化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a277e5678ab057d",
      "translationZh": "为了针对 i.MX 95 SoC 优化推理，我们在不同模块上探索了多种量化技术。我们发现，对视觉编码器和 LLM 预填充进行量化对准确性的影响有限，而对动作专家中的去噪流程进行量化则会显著降低性能。这种现象符合预期，因为量化误差会在迭代去噪步骤中不断累积。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a6e17e6d5946d07",
      "translationZh": "因此，我们决定让该模块保持较高精度，以维持稳定性；而在其他模块上，我们则根据不同层探索了从 8-bit 混合精度到 4-bit 量化的多种量化配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "56387392e2bce5f5",
      "translationZh": "此外，我们还对不同模块进行了内部优化。结果如下表所示，其中称为优化后的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "11c04db8fa4478d8",
      "translationZh": "3) 异步推理：控制感知调度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84e085a66fdef66e",
      "translationZh": "在同步控制循环中，流水线按以下流程运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "41fff01938740bba",
      "translationZh": "采集观测数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "965551a05e9d21a7",
      "translationZh": "运行完整的模型推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "075440773a1f851f",
      "translationZh": "执行生成的动作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "148e88e67da58d54",
      "translationZh": "在步骤 (2) 期间，机器人处于空闲状态。如果推理延迟不可忽略，就会导致：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "97f0bd28cae29967",
      "translationZh": "运动过程中的空闲间隙",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cd4d8afd99f4efd8",
      "translationZh": "因观测信息过时而产生的振荡修正",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "58bc6890412e5b7c",
      "translationZh": "降低有效控制频率",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b5fcf33194734598",
      "translationZh": "较差的恢复行为",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "93778ec38007cb0a",
      "translationZh": "借助异步推理，动作生成与执行并行运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1655196f6b004a2b",
      "translationZh": "机器人执行当前动作块",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6ae902f3674231d1",
      "translationZh": "同时计算下一个动作块",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6fd85896383d7db2",
      "translationZh": "这会提高有效控制频率，减少观测信息的过时程度，并改善恢复行为。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e90f2ec42d49edf",
      "translationZh": "在 i.MX 95 SoC 等嵌入式平台上，异步推理至关重要，但只有在将推理延迟控制在动作时域预算以内时才有效：推理时间 < 执行时间",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
